# Fun Arcade

A polished, mobile-friendly arcade web app with multiple mini-games in one place.

## Included games
- Memory Match
- Tic-Tac-Toe
- Reaction Rush
- Number Guess
- Rock Paper Scissors
- Simon Says

## Features
- Responsive layout for mobile and desktop
- Score persistence between sessions using localStorage
- Installable PWA support for mobile browsers
- Clean arcade-style interface
- Simple static HTML/CSS/JS setup

## Run locally
Open the project folder and launch a static server with any tool you prefer, for example:

```bash
python -m http.server 8000
```

Then visit:

```text
http://localhost:8000
```

You can also simply open `index.html` directly in a browser.

## Deploy to GitHub Pages
1. Push the repo to GitHub
2. Open the repository Settings
3. Go to Pages
4. Select Deploy from a branch
5. Choose the `main` branch and root folder
6. Save

Your app will be available at:

```text
https://<username>.github.io/<repo>/
```

## Production note
This is built as a premium static web app and is ideal for GitHub Pages or mobile browser install. A full Android APK requires Android Studio or another native packaging tool.
